# Chennai Flood Early Warning & AI Safe Navigation System

An intelligent, real-time hydrological simulation and dynamic emergency routing engine designed for Chennai's urban flood resilience. The platform integrates digital elevation models, live precipitation data, and dynamic graph-weight penalization to compute safe transit corridors for emergency response vehicles and citizens during severe monsoonal events.

---

## 📸 Key Features & Visual Walkthrough

> *Note: Place all screenshots in the `screenshots/` directory using the referenced filenames.*

### 1. Interactive Flood Severity Heatmap & Elevation Grid
Dynamic visualization of Chennai's road network categorized by real-time waterlogging depths (Safe, Moderate, Severe, Inundated).
![Elevation & Inundation Map](screenshots/01_flood_map_overview.png)

### 2. Real-Time Meteorological Synchronization
Live automated weather ingestion via Open-Meteo API capturing current precipitation, humidity, wind velocity, and local cloud cover in Chennai.
![Live Weather Ingestion](screenshots/02_live_weather_sync.png)

### 3. Dynamic Hydrological Flood Simulation
Interactive simulation controls allowing users to adjust rainfall intensity ($mm/hr$), duration ($minutes$), and drainage efficiency factors to predict localized water column depths across 74,000+ road segments.
![Hydrology Simulation Controls](screenshots/03_hydrology_simulation.png)

### 4. A* Safe Navigation vs. Shortest Path Routing
Heuristic pathfinding engine demonstrating both standard shortest routes (often cut off by deep water) and dynamically rerouted flood-safe corridors avoiding hazardous roads.
![A-Star Safe Routing Demo](screenshots/04_astar_routing_comparison.png)

### 5. Critical Healthcare Facility Proximity
Geospatial overlay of 1,200+ hospitals and emergency triage centers across Chennai, enabling direct safe-route computation during medical evacuations.
![Hospital & Medical Centers](screenshots/05_hospital_network.png)

### 6. Municipal Drainage & Manhole Asset Management
Crowdsourced citizen reporting interface and municipal console for logging blocked drains, choked culverts, and resolving water flow bottlenecks with photo proof.
![Drainage Asset Reporting](screenshots/06_manhole_reporting.png)

