## 🛠️ Architecture & Tech Stack

* **Backend Engine:** Python 3.11, FastAPI, Uvicorn
* **Spatial Graph Algorithms:** NetworkX (Heuristic $A^*$ routing with dynamic edge weighting)
* **Frontend Visualization:** Leaflet.js, OpenStreetMap GeoJSON layers, Vanilla JS / CSS3
* **Data Sources:** OpenStreetMap Highway GeoJSON, Chennai Elevation Raster/GeoJSON, Open-Meteo Weather API
* **Deployment Support:** Docker, Google Cloud Run, GitHub Pages

---

## ⚡ Local Setup & Execution

### Prerequisites
* Python 3.10 or higher
* Git

### Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/bravo0001/chennai-flood-ops.git](https://github.com/bravo0001/chennai-flood-ops.git)
cd chennai-flood-ops

# Create and activate virtual environment
python -m venv .venv
# On Windows:
.\.venv\Scripts\activate
# On Linux/macOS:
source .venv/bin/activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt